<title>GERMANY: Gardena spreads roots through Europe.</title>
<headline>Gardena spreads roots through Europe.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's newly-floated garden equipment maker Gardena Holding AG said on Monday it was taking over the Belgian, Dutch, Portuguese and Danish marketing and distribution units of Netherlands-based Markt Group Holdings.</p>
<p>Gardena said it already had an indirect 28 percent holding in the businesses to be acquired. It said in a mandatory statement the consolidation of the units would increase its 1997/98 sales by around 30 million marks and benefit earnings.</p>
<p>No details were given on the price paid for the acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
